  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>&#128144; 재과만에서 만난 ‘나의 선생님’도 들려주세요.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">질문에 답해준 선생님, 수업 아이디어를 나눠준 선생님, 막막한 순간에 힘이 되어준 선생님은 누구였나요?&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">더 빨리 찾아오지 못하여 죄송합니다. 마음이 담긴 편지 전해드립니다. &#10084;&#65039;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7bd6089db70e905f435250bac1ab30fdcc09f784\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7bd6089db70e905f435250bac1ab30fdcc09f784\" data-origin-width=\"717\" data-origin-height=\"510\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b3032faf8f165bfc49aa894f2a1606668a9c96f9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b3032faf8f165bfc49aa894f2a1606668a9c96f9\" data-origin-width=\"942\" data-origin-height=\"523\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c3c038fc024d13fdd09f2451d6bf4ca2cc547d66\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c3c038fc024d13fdd09f2451d6bf4ca2cc547d66\" data-origin-width=\"948\" data-origin-height=\"525\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52045373886250e99ff2b0f828f66bb361d6fb10\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52045373886250e99ff2b0f828f66bb361d6fb10\" data-origin-width=\"712\" data-origin-height=\"528\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobi